pan class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-bf81cb1a5473b115END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-96a5d13606a88fd1END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_LOW_TargetList</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_LOW_TargetList\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_LOW_TargetList\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">4ece815c-aff2-45c3-8b07-dd3a04454243</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:4ece815c-aff2-45c3-8b07-dd3a04454243\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:4ece815c-aff2-45c3-8b07-dd3a04454243\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On the table to the right of the room's entrance to <a href=\"/wiki/Fraygo%27s_Flophouse\" title=\"Fraygo's Flophouse\">Fraygo's Flophouse</a></li>\n<li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Peartree%27s_Home\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Peartree's Home\">Peartree's Home</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;41&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-96</span></li>\n<li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Rainforest%27s_Home\" title=\"Rainforest's Home\">Rainforest's Home</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-90&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-117</span></li>\n<li>Given by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Olfaith_Olumssdottir\" title=\"Olfaith Olumssdottir\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/eb/Portrait_Olfaith_Olumssdottir.png/25px-Portrait_Olfaith_Olumssdottir.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/eb/Portrait_Olfaith_Olumssdottir.png/38px-Portrait_Olfaith_Olumssdottir.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/eb/Portrait_Olfaith_Olumssdottir.png/50px-Portrait_Olfaith_Olumssdottir.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Olfaith Olumssdottir\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/eb/Portrait_Olfaith_Olumssdottir.png/25px-Portrait_Olfaith_Olumssdottir.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/eb/Portrait_Olfaith_Olumssdottir.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Olfaith_Olumssdottir\" title=\"Olfaith Olumssdottir\">Olfaith Olumssdottir</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[Messy splatters of deep red-brown adorn this scrap of parchment.]\n</p><p><br>\nThose wishing to face the <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal\" title=\"Bhaal\">Dread Lord's</a> Tribunal and enter the <a href=\"/wiki/Temple_of_Bhaal\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temple of Bhaal\">Temple of Bhaal</a> must slay the targets on this list and frame the corpses as a murder by the cult of the Absolute.\n</p><p>Bring the victim's hand as proof of the killing. Walk in blood, Aspirant.\n</p><p><br>\nDuke <a href=\"/wiki/Belynne_Stelmane\" title=\"Belynne Stelmane\">Belynne Stelmane</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/Elfsong_Tavern\" title=\"Elfsong Tavern\">Elfsong Tavern</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a>. <i>(Killed)</i>\n</p><p><br>\nFather <a href=\"/wiki/Lorgan\" title=\"Lorgan\">Lorgan</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/Open_Hand_Temple\" title=\"Open Hand Temple\">Open Hand Temple</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a>. <i>(Killed)</i>\n</p><p><br>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Dribbles\" title=\"Dribbles\">Dribbles</a> the Clown - <a href=\"/wiki/Circus_of_the_Last_Days\" title=\"Circus of the Last Days\">Circus of the Last Days</a>, Rivington. <i>(Killed)</i>\n</p><p><br>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Alexander_Rainforest\" title=\"Alexander Rainforest\">Alexander Rainforest</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/Rainforest%27s_Home\" title=\"Rainforest's Home\">Office</a> near the <a href=\"/wiki/Counting_House\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Counting House\">Counting House</a>, Lower City. <i>(Killed)</i>\n</p><p><br>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Franc_Peartree\" title=\"Franc Peartree\">Franc Peartree</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/Peartree%27s_Home\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Peartree's Home\">Abode</a> near <a href=\"/wiki/Felogyr%27s_Fireworks\" title=\"Felogyr's Fireworks\">Feolgyr's Fireworks</a>, Lower City. <i>(Killed)</i>\n</p><p><br>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Cora_Highberry\" title=\"Cora Highberry\">Cora Highberry</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/Highberry%27s_Home\" title=\"Highberry's Home\">Large home</a> near <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Mouth\" title=\"Baldur's Mouth\">Baldur's Mouth</a> Gazette, Lower City.\n</p><p><br>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Figaro_Pennygood\" title=\"Figaro Pennygood\">Figaro Pennygood</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/Facemaker%27s_Boutique\" title=\"Facemaker's Boutique\">Facemaker's Fashion</a>, Lower City.\n</p><p><br>\nChef <a href=\"/wiki/Roveer\" title=\"Roveer\">Roveer</a> - Elfsong Tavern kitchen, Lower City.\n</p><p><br>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Nesha_Leesha\" title=\"Nesha Leesha\">Nesha Leesha</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/Blushing_Mermaid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Blushing Mermaid\">Blushing Mermaid</a>, Lower City.\n</p><p><br>\nVarri Vanthampur - Vanthampur Villa, Upper City.\n</p><p><br>\nFridrik Hhune - Hhune House, Upper City.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The last two entries of the parchment are victims which cannot be found in-game, mainly because the <a href=\"/wiki/Upper_City\" title=\"Upper City\">Upper City</a> is only partially accessible</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195805\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.066 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.069 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2138/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 41077/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 15422/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 932003/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   54.462      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   54.462      1 -total\n 63.46%   34.562      9 Template:Icon_text\n 56.64%   30.848     23 Template:Trim\n 35.62%   19.399      1 Template:PageSeo\n 35.49%   19.328      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 27.74%   15.107      4 Template:Icon_link\n 20.15%   10.976      1 Template:Quest\n 19.76%   10.763      9 Template:Ifempty\n 18.39%   10.017      2 Template:Uid\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:16017-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195805 and revision id 372820. Rendering was triggered because: u